items.details:
Wrap both shells in ProductionContext. Its value comes from the demo menu toggle 'Show prototype notes', default OFF for the call and stored in localStorage behind try/catch.

At OFF:
- every DemoNote is hidden;
- the video card is hidden;
- the disabled 'Download PDF' is hidden;
- the Completeness 'in this prototype…' sentence is hidden.

The toggle does not change any behaviour.

Tabs: Overview · Questionnaire · Open points · Documents · Internal notes · History.

The Questionnaire tab holds:
- a 'Live scope' banner from ScopeTab:39-61, including the origin-without-rules flag;
- the metadata answers as the first block of General information;
- a section list showing each section's applicability badge and its 'why in scope' reason;
- a toggle 'Show not-applicable sections (n)';
- the evidence chips the rules ask for.

Remove the Overview 'Metadata answers' card. Rename 'Audit trail' to 'History' here, because the global page is the Audit trail. Old ?tab=scope links map to ?tab=questionnaire.

**Header:** name, phase badge, waiting-on badge, flags, then the line 'ID · INCI · supplier' and 'Owner · Due'.

**Moved to Overview 'Case facts':** template and rule-set versions.

**Removed:**
- the 'Stage' row;
- the 'Review v…' badge (COPY-01);
- the 'Not a raw-material approval' badge repeated on every confirmation row (OverviewTab.tsx:212). The card subtitle already says it.

An 'Edit case' action on the case page, for RMM only. It changes:
- the due date (must be in the future);
- the priority;
- the owner (RMM's review track moves to the new owner, and the new owner gets a mail);
- the target markets (add only after completeness; adding one may open sections);
- the case contacts, chosen from the supplier master, at least one. An added contact gets the invitation mail; a removed contact loses portal access to that request.

Every change is audited. Closed cases are read-only.

The start state and the 'Reset to empty start' state are the same:
- all internal role holders, including the second users if reassignment is kept;
- supplier s1 'Solvaro Oleochemicals S.A.', fictional, with Elena Márquez and Ravi Menon, both active and able to confirm;
- the published configuration;
- zero cases, zero audit events and empty mailboxes.

The storage schema version is bumped so an old seeded localStorage is discarded on first load.
